  "title": "Mandragora: Whispers of the Witch Tree Now Available on PlayStation®5 and Nintendo Switch in Asia",
  "summary": "SINGAPORE, Sept. 04, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- GCL Global Holdings Ltd. (Nasdaq: GCL) (“GCL” or the “Company”), a leading provider of games and entertainment, today announced that “Mandragora: Whispers of the Witch Tree” is now available on PlayStation®5 and Nintendo Switch console platforms in Asia, in both digital and physical editions. The dark fantasy RPG game from Primal Game Studio is published outside of Asia by Knights Peak Interactive (“Knights Peak”) and regionally published in Asia by",
